    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d300">

                <pb facs="0411" n="400" xml:id="pg400"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">362.1121 Hirsch, Helmut/48: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dodd</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-06-01T17:00:00-04:00">June 1, 1937—5 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>52. Your telegrams 120, 121<anchor n="11" xml:id="d300-f1"/> and 123. We fully
                    approve your actions and trust that you will continue to exert every effort to
                    secure commutation of sentence. The matter is being kept confidential here.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
